<title>USA: Dyersburg, Tenn., won by Suntrust Cap Mkts.</title>
<headline>Dyersburg, Tenn., won by Suntrust Cap Mkts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suntrust Cap Mkts said it won $3 million of Dyersburg, Tenn, electric system revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.326  percent.</p>
</text>
